= 🌍 Geomancer — Gear Guide =

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Source:** No FFXIclopedia gear table exists for GEO — built from BG-Wiki's *Compendium of Colure* and shared gear knowledge across this collection (BLM/SCH/SMN/RDM share most slots).

