(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**GEO is a bubble support job.** **Indi-X** = single-target buff/debuff on a player. **Geo-X** = AoE bubble around a Luopan pet. The Luopan persists until killed, dispelled, or replaced. Both spells scale with **Geomancy Skill**, the **handbell** equipped, and your **MND** (cure-type) or **MAB** (damage-type) for the active spell.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**The handbell matters more than for any other instrument-using job.** Each grade of handbell adds tangible Indi/Geo potency on top of Geomancy Skill. **Idris** (Mythic) adds +10 Geomancy Skill outright — it's the single biggest upgrade in the entire job.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You support — Indi/Geo bubbles / Bolster / Ecliptic Attrition / Life Cycle / Dematerialize / Mending Halation / Concentric Pulse. Need: Tank, healer, DPS. **No second GEO** — Sylvie UC's Entrust gambit is gated on a non-GEO master.

