<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ferreous_Coffin">Ferreous Coffin</a></strong></td><td>Haste on all, **Raise III**, Refresh II passive, status removal</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun interrupts</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ayame">Ayame</a></strong></td><td>Self-sufficient SAM DPS</td></tr>
