= ⚔️ Weapons =

== Handbell (Primary) ==

(% class="legend-box" %)
**The handbell is GEO's signature weapon.** Higher-grade handbells boost Indi/Geo potency directly via **Geomancy Skill +X**. This is non-negotiable — your single most important slot.

