----

= 📋 Endgame Set Cheat-Sheet =

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Indi vs Geo gear differs.** **Indi-X** = single-target buff/debuff on a player — gear for **duration** (Idris + Bagua AF). **Geo-X** = Luopan AoE bubble — gear for **potency** (handbell, MND/MAB depending on type, Geomancy Skill+).

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:160px;">Set</th><th>Pieces</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>Idle / Refresh</strong></td><td>Idris (or best handbell) · Twilight Cape · Goliard Saio (Conserve MP) · Yigit Seraweels (Refresh) · Walahra Turban · Tamas Ring · Vivian Ring · Hedgehog Bomb</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Indi-Spell Cast (Duration)</strong></td><td>**Idris** · Bagua Galero +1 · Bagua Tunic +1 · Bagua Mitaines +1 · Bagua Pants +1 · Bagua Sandals +1 — full GEO AF+1 set extends Indi duration significantly</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Geo-Spell Cast (Potency / MND or MAB)</strong></td><td>**Idris** + Geomancy Skill stack: Azimuth set / Bagua AF+1 · Marduk's Tiara · Goliard Cuffs · Goliard Clogs · Elemental Torque (damage Geo) / Communion Ring +1 (cure Geo)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Geo-Frend / Damage Bubble (MAB Burst)</strong></td><td>Daybreak / element-matched staff · Hecate's Cape · Uggalepih Pendant (<51% MP) · Moldavite Earring · Static Earring (Magic Burst) · Omniscient Ring +1 · **Elemental Obi** matching day/weather · Sturm's Report ammo</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Bolster Macro</strong></td><td>**Bagua Galero +1** — when up, Bolster doubles bubble effect for ~3 minutes. Macro-equip for cast</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Ecliptic Attrition Macro</strong></td><td>**Bagua Sandals +1** — extends bubble life. Macro-equip for cast</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>HMP Resting</strong></td><td>Mahatma Hat / Yigit Turban · Mahatma Houppelande / Yigit Gomlek · Cobra Gloves · Yigit Seraweels · Avocat Pigaches / Goliard Clogs · Beak Necklace +1 · Mohbwa Sash +1 · Pluto's Staff · Relaxing Earring · Magnetic Earring</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Movement / Luopan Reposition</strong></td><td>Herald's Gaiters · Idris (movement speed boost on some HQs) — Luopan only follows you up to a distance, so position carefully then walk into your group</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}
